#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&granatier; is a clone of the classic <trademark><application>Bomberman</"
"application></trademark> game, inspired by the work of the "
"<application>Clanbomber</application> clone."
msgstr ""
"&granatier; je klon klasične <trademark><application>Bomberman</"
"application></trademark> igre, inspirisan radom <application>Clanbomber</"
"application> klona."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The object of the game is to run through an arena, using bombs to clear out "
"blocks and eliminate your opponents. Several bonuses and handicaps are "
"hidden underneath the blocks &ndash; these can either help or hinder your "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"Cilj igre je proći kroz arenu, korsiteći bombe da se uklone blokovi i "
"eliminiraju protivnici. Nekoliko bonusa i hendikepa je sakriveno ispod "
"blokova &ndash; i oni mogu ili pomoći ili ometati vaš napredak."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A &granatier; screenshot</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>A &granatier; slika ekrana</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A &granatier; screenshot</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A &granatier; slika ekrana</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Eliminate all Opponents."
msgstr "Odstranite sve protivnike."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each player is provided with five keys that they use to move their character "
"and lay bombs. For example, the default keys for Player 1 are the Up, Down, "
"Left and Right arrow keys to move respectively in those directions, and the "
"&Enter; key to lay a bomb. Please refer to the <link linkend=\"config_player"
"\">Player Configuration</link> Section to find shortcut keys for other "
"players, as well as how to configure them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The purpose of laying bombs, aside from attacking other opponents, is to "
"destroy the many blocks scattered throughout the arena in order to clear a "
"path or uncover hidden bonuses. Among the many bonuses that can be uncovered "
"are those that make you move faster or increase your bomb blast range; the "
"more bonuses of this type you collect, the easier it is to eliminate your "
"opponents and win the round. But be warned that just as many handicaps exist "
"that can turn the tide against you, including those that slow you down or "
"invert your moving keys."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each won round, the player is awarded a point. The first player to win a "
"predefined number of points (the default is 3), wins the game!"
msgstr ""
"Za svaku osvojenu rundu, igrač dobije nagradni bod. Prvi igrač koji osvoji "
"unaprijed određen broj bodova(obično je to 3), osvaja igru!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Items"
msgstr "Stavke"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Arena"
msgstr "Arena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "The players are in an arena which consists of:"
msgstr "Igrači su u areni koja se sastoji od:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena Wall"
msgstr "Zid Arene"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Wall &ndash; this defines the outline of the arena map and cannot be "
"destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Zid &ndash; ovo definira krajnje granice mape arene i ne može biti uništeno."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena Ground"
msgstr "Tlo arene"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ground &ndash; this can be walked on safely."
msgstr "Tlo &ndash; ovdje je sigurno hodati."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena Ice"
msgstr "Arena led"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Ice &ndash; this will make the ground slippery. The speed increases on "
"the ice and it is not possible to completly stop moving."
msgstr ""
"Led &nadsh; zbog njega će tlo biti klizavo. Brzina se povećava na ledu i "
"nemoguće je u potpunosti se zaustaviti."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena Block"
msgstr "Arena blok"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Block &ndash; this can be destroyed with a bomb, and may contain a bonus "
"(or a handicap)."
msgstr ""
"Blok &ndash; može biti uništen sa bombom, i može sadržavati bonus(ili "
"hendikep)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena Bomb Mortar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Bomb Mortar &ndash; this will throw bombs that are placed on it to "
"random places."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena Arrow Right"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Arrows &ndash; this will move the bombs that are placed on it to the "
"direction they point."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If there is none of the above items, there is a hole at the ground and "
"moving into it will result in falling into the deep and die. The same "
"applies also if there is no wall at the edge of the arena and the player "
"moves outside of the arena."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Bonuses"
msgstr "Bonusi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bonuses are helpful for reaching the game goal and effects exists permanent "
"- even after a handicap disappears. Currently there are following bonuses:"
msgstr ""
"Bonusi su korisni za dostizanje cilja igre i njihovi efekti su permanenti - "
"vrijede čak i kada hendikep nestane. Trenutno postoje sljedeći bonusi:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Speed"
msgstr "Bonus brzina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed &ndash; increases your speed slightly."
msgstr "Brzina &ndash; blago uveća vašu brzinu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Bomb"
msgstr "Bonus bombe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bomb &ndash; adds an extra bomb to your arsenal, allowing you to lay more "
"than one bomb at a time."
msgstr ""
"Bomba &ndash; dodaje još jednu bombu u vaš arsenal, omogućavajući vam da "
"nosite više od jedne bombe istovremeno."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Power"
msgstr "Bonus snaga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Power &ndash; increases the power of your bombs, extending their bomb blast "
"range."
msgstr "Snaga &ndash; povećava razornu moć i  snagu vaših bombi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Shield"
msgstr "Bonus štit"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shield &ndash; makes invincible for one bomb blast."
msgstr "Štit &ndash; postanete nevidljivi tijekom jedne eksplozije bombe."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Throw"
msgstr "Bonus bacanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Throw &ndash; adds the ability to throw bombs. Just press the key for laying "
"bombs while a bomb is below you."
msgstr ""
"Bacanje &ndash; dodaje vam mogućnost da bacate bombe. Samo pritisnite tipku "
"za postavljanje bombi dok je bomba ispod vas."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Kick"
msgstr "Bonus udarac"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kick &ndash; adds the ability to move bombs. Just run against an bomb and "
"the bomb will move."
msgstr ""
"Udarac &ndash; dodaje mogućnost da pomjerate bombe. Jednostavno trčite u "
"suprotnom smjeru od bombe i bomba će se pomjeriti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Handicaps"
msgstr "Hendikepi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Handicaps are the opposite of bonuses and hinder the player. The good thing "
"is that effects get lost after some time (other than bonuses) and the player "
"can play in is usual behavior (including bonuses) again. Currently there are "
"following handicaps:"
msgstr ""
"Hendikepi su suprotna stvar od bonusa i spriječavaju napredak igrača. Dobra "
"stvar je da se efekat hendikepa izgubi nakon određenog vremena(što nije "
"slučaj kod bonusa) i igrač može igrati na uobičajeni način(također, i bonusi "
"su aktivni opet). Trenutno postoje sljedeći hendikepi:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handicap Slow"
msgstr "Handikep usporenja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Slow &ndash; makes you move very slowly."
msgstr "Usporenje &ndash; postanete jako spori."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handicap Hyperactive"
msgstr "Hendikep hiperaktivnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hyperactive &ndash; makes you move a little TOO fast."
msgstr "Hiperaktivnost &ndash; postanete prebrzi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handicap Mirror"
msgstr "Hendikep ogledala"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Mirror &ndash; inverts your moving keys, so that up becomes down and left "
"becomes right."
msgstr ""
"Ogledalo &ndash; izvrne vaše tipke za upravljanje, tako da gore postane "
"dolje a lijevo postane desno."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handicap Scatty"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scatty &ndash; forces you to continuously lay bombs without control."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handicap Restrain"
msgstr "Hendikep sprječavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restrain &ndash; prevents you to lay bombs."
msgstr "Sprječavanje &ndash; sprječava vas da postavljate bombe."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "The ambivalent Items"
msgstr "Ostale stavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This type of bonuses are neither good nor bad, it mostly depends on the "
"environment. Currently there are following neutral bonuses:"
msgstr ""
"Ove vrste bonusa ne spadaju niti u dobre niti u loše, to isključivo zavisi "
"od trenutnog okruženja. Trenutno postoje sljedeći neutralni bonusi:"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Neutral Pandora"
msgstr "Bonus neutralna pandora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pandora &ndash; this contains either a bonus or a handicap."
msgstr "Pandora &ndash; ovo sadržava ili bonus ili hendikep."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus Neutral Resurrect"
msgstr "Bonus neutralno uskrsnuće"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resurrect &ndash; this will resurrect any dead player."
msgstr "Uskrsnuće &ndash; ovo će uskrsnuti mrtvog igrača."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanja igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open the Configuration Dialogue, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &granatier;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Da otvorite dijalog za podešavanja, odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Podesi &granatier;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the points which are needed to win the game and the time for "
"a round. After the time is over, the sudden death mode will start."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati koliko je bodova potrebno da se pobjedi u igri i vrijemensko "
"trajanje jedne runde. Nakon što vrijeme istekne, počet će iznenadne smrti "
"igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally you can adjust the initial speed, bomb range and bomb armory."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno, možete podesiti inicijalnu brzinu, razornu moć bombe i skladište "
"bombi."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:262 index.docbook:279 index.docbook:299 index.docbook:313
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A &granatier; Config screenshot</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:268 index.docbook:285 index.docbook:305 index.docbook:319
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A &granatier; Config screenshot</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select the Theme you want to play, go to the Theme section. The Theme is "
"loaded by clicking on <guibutton>OK</guibutton> or <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton>. The current game will be ended and a new one started. You can "
"click on the <guibutton>Defaults</guibutton> button to restore the default "
"Theme."
msgstr ""
"Da izaberete temu koju želite igrati, idite na sekciju Teme. Tema se učitava "
"klikom na dugme <guibutton>OK</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Primjeni</"
"guibutton>. Trenutna igra će završiti i nova će početi. Možete kliknuti na "
"dugme <guibutton>Početna tema</guibutton> da vratite početnu uobičajenu temu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arena"
msgstr "Arena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select the Arena you want to play, go to the Arena section. The Arena is "
"loaded by clicking on <guibutton>OK</guibutton> or <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton>. The current game will be ended and a new one started. You can "
"click on the <guibutton>Defaults</guibutton> button to restore the default "
"Arena."
msgstr ""
"Da biste izabrali Arenu u kojoj želite igrati, idite na Arena sekciju. Arena "
"se učita kada kliknete na dugme <guibutton>OK</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>Primjeni</guibutton>. Trenutna igra će završiti i nova će početi. "
"Možete kliknuti na dugme <guibutton>Početna Arena</guibutton> da vratite "
"početnu uobičajenu Arenu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have self-made <application>Clanbomber</application> arenas, you can "
"import them by clicking on <guibutton>Import Clanbomber Arenas</guibutton>. "
"&granatier; is looking in <filename class=\"directory\">~/.clanbomber/maps</"
"filename> for the arenas. The default <application>Clanbomber</application> "
"arenas are already shipped with &granatier;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select <guibutton>Random Mode</guibutton>, a random arena will be "
"used for each new round. If there are arenas you don't want to play, you can "
"uncheck them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "Player"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select the Player you want to play, go to the Player section and select "
"the Players with the checkboxes. The Shortcuts can be changed by clicking on "
"the button for the action you want to change and then pressing the key you "
"want to use. The changes are loaded by clicking on <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"or <guibutton>Apply</guibutton>. The current game will be ended and a new "
"one started. You can click on the <guibutton>Defaults</guibutton> button to "
"restore the default Shortcuts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a custom Arena"
msgstr "Napravi vlastitu Arenu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An Arena in &granatier; consists of two files, the <filename>myarena."
"desktop</filename> and the <filename>myarena.xml</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Arena u &granatier; se sastoji od dvije datoteke, <filename>myarena.desktop</"
"filename> i <filename>myarena.xml</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The .desktop file contains the metadata like the arena name or the author of "
"the arena and consists of the following entries. <programlisting>\n"
"[Arena]\n"
"Name=My Arena\n"
"Description=This is my first Arena\n"
"Type=XML\n"
"FileName=myarena.xml\n"
"Author=Joe User\n"
"AuthorEmail=joe.user@foo.org\n"
"      </programlisting> You can choose whatever name you want, but FileName "
"must be the name of the .xml file."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka sa ekstenzijom .desktop file contains the metadata like the arena "
"name or the author of the arena and consists of the following entries. "
"<programlisting>\n"
"[Arena]\n"
"Name=My Arena\n"
"Description=This is my first Arena\n"
"Type=XML\n"
"FileName=myarena.xml\n"
"Author=Joe User\n"
"AuthorEmail=joe.user@foo.org\n"
"      </programlisting> You can choose whatever name you want, but FileName "
"must be the name of the .xml file."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The .xml file contains the actual arena map. <programlisting>\n"
"&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"?&gt;\n"
"&lt;Arena arenaFileVersion=\"1\" rowCount=\"13\" colCount=\"17\"&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;    ==== ====    &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  ===+++++++===  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  =+++++_+++++=  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt; ==+++=_p_=+++== &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;==++===_-_===++==&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;=+++=++_-_++=+++=&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt; +++++-- --+++++ &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;=+++=++_-_++=+++=&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;==++===_-_===++==&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt; ==+++=_p_=+++== &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  =+++++_+++++=  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  ===+++++++===  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;    ==== ====    &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"&lt;/Arena&gt;\n"
"      </programlisting> There is no limit for rowCount and colCount, so you "
"can choose the size of the arena by yourself. The following symbols are used "
"for the arena map."
msgstr ""
".xml datoteka sadrži aktuelnu arena mapu. <programlisting>\n"
"&lt;?xml version=\"1.0\"?&gt;\n"
"&lt;Arena arenaFileVersion=\"1\" rowCount=\"13\" colCount=\"17\"&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;    ==== ====    &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  ===+++++++===  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  =+++++_+++++=  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt; ==+++=_p_=+++== &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;==++===_-_===++==&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;=+++=++_-_++=+++=&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt; +++++-- --+++++ &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;=+++=++_-_++=+++=&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;==++===_-_===++==&lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt; ==+++=_p_=+++== &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  =+++++_+++++=  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;  ===+++++++===  &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"  &lt;Row&gt;    ==== ====    &lt;/Row&gt;\n"
"&lt;/Arena&gt;\n"
"      </programlisting> Ne postoji limit za rowCount icolCount, tako da "
"možete izabrati proizvoljnu veličinu arene. Sljedeći simboli se koriste za "
"mapu arene."

